   {
    "text": "The file is a clean, deliberate-looking change: one column appended at the end, the other 14 columns unchanged in order, no empty cells, and a single consistent code (`IN`) on every row. It isn't a dropped column or junk, so a contract change is the right response. I'll add the column with `allowed: [IN]` and bump the version.",
